          }
        },
        "heading_9ARaUE": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How it Started",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_YMVND7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Taare began with us: Chandni, Siddharth, and Nishant. </p><p>Three parents who wanted better shoes for our own kids. </p><p>We found that choosing the right footwear for older kids was often confusing. </p><p>Many options for children over age 4 relied on low quality materials or toddler-style designs that no longer supported healthy growth.<br/><br/>We created Taare to change that. </p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_X8GTF3",
        "heading_9ARaUE",
        "text_YMVND7"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/About_Us_trio.png",
        "image_width": 700,
        "image_link": "",
        "image_position": "right",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "color_scheme": "2"
      }
    },
    "5d80e24d-359e-4497-b5e7-90275162de31": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "88949fd5-8250-4a34-9a66-e89dc0c91026": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Subheading"
          }
        },
        "template--15213462618185__5d80e24d-359e-4497-b5e7-90275162de31-heading-1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Designed with Care",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "template--15213462618185__5d80e24d-359e-4497-b5e7-90275162de31-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>From the start, our goal was simple: to create footwear that parents can trust and kids love to wear.</p><p>That meant investing time to understand how kids’ feet grow, and carefully identifying materials that provide comfort, durability, and breathability. </p><p>We shortlisted designs and constructions that encourage natural movement and support healthy development. </p><p>Every choice reflects our goal of helping kids feel comfortable and confident with every step.<br/><br/></p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "88949fd5-8250-4a34-9a66-e89dc0c91026",
        "template--15213462618185__5d80e24d-359e-4497-b5e7-90275162de31-heading-1",
        "template--15213462618185__5d80e24d-359e-4497-b5e7-90275162de31-text-1"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Taare_Gift.png",
        "image_width": 700,
        "image_link": "",
        "image_position": "left",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "color_scheme": "2"
      }
    },
    "e349fe82-4ed8-48b7-b15a-84eb3a247d25": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "aa8f8936-073f-42af-b9ae-2458a23ee7b9": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Subheading"
          }
        },
        "template--15213462618185__e349fe82-4ed8-48b7-b15a-84eb3a247d25-heading-1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Born of Purpose",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "template--15213462618185__e349fe82-4ed8-48b7-b15a-84eb3a247d25-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>For us, Taare is not just about making great products. </p><p>It is about the belief that every child has limitless potential and deserves an opportunity to shine. </p><p>That is why we channel a portion of every sale toward shoe donations, essential supplies, and community drives. </p><p>By supporting families beyond our own, we hope to make life a little easier and brighter for children everywhere.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "aa8f8936-073f-42af-b9ae-2458a23ee7b9",
        "template--15213462618185__e349fe82-4ed8-48b7-b15a-84eb3a247d25-heading-1",
        "template--15213462618185__e349fe82-4ed8-48b7-b15a-84eb3a247d25-text-1"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/taare-shoe-donation-drive-2.jpg",
        "image_width": 700,
        "image_link": "",
        "image_position": "right",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "color_scheme": "2"
      }
    },
    "image_with_text_paVL7i": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_HHccTy": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Subheading"
          }
        },
        "heading_6jKgWF": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Extending Shoe Life",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_mXQp8g": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>With our free shipping labels and the support of our friends at Soles4Souls, gently used Taare shoes find new life around the world.</p><p>In the process, families that resell these shoes for a living are able to generate income and strengthen their community through sustainable entrepreneurship.</p><p>And when shoes are diverted away from landfills, the planet heals.</p><p>You can learn more about Soles4Souls and their 4Opportunity and 4Planet programs <a href=\"https://soles4souls.org/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://soles4souls.org/\">here</a>.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_HHccTy",
        "heading_6jKgWF",
        "text_mXQp8g"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Shoe_donation.png",
        "image_width": 700,
        "image_link": "",
        "image_position": "left",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "color_scheme": "2"
      }
    },
    "image_with_text_MeDtRL": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_CtPAGN": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Subheading"
          }
        },
        "heading_wkH8bi": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "The Meaning Behind Taare",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_zcGrkk": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>\"Taare\" (pronounced: Taa-ray) means stars in Hindi. </p><p>We chose this name because it reflects how we see children: bright, unique, and full of potential. </p><p>It is a reminder to design products that support them as they grow, explore, and shine in their own way.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_CtPAGN",
        "heading_wkH8bi",
        "text_zcGrkk"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Kids_star_fingers.png",
        "image_width": 700,
        "image_link": "",
        "image_position": "right",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "color_scheme": "2"
      }
    },
    "image_with_text_jVX7dm": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_GrpQPz": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Subheading"
          }
        },
        "heading_MpFedh": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "The Journey Ahead",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_epz9aG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our mission started with shoes, but it does not end there. </p><p>We plan to expand into newer categories, always with the same purpose: to create thoughtful products that support children and give parents peace of mind. </p><p>Because when children grow with the right support, there is no limit to where they can go.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_GrpQPz",
        "heading_MpFedh",
        "text_epz9aG"
      ],
      "settings": {
